  translate 0 hpt M 4 {72 rotate 0 hpt L} repeat
  Opaque stroke grestore } def
/CircW { stroke [] 0 setdash 
  hpt 0 360 arc Opaque stroke } def
/BoxFill { gsave Rec 1 setgray fill grestore } def
